EXPERIMENT 8: HOSPITAL APPOINTMENT BOOKING SYSTEM
1. AIM
To design and develop a Hospital Appointment Booking System using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript that allows patients to view doctors, select departments, book appointments, choose appointment dates and times, and receive booking confirmation.
2. ALGORITHM
1. Start the program.
2. Create a webpage for the hospital appointment booking system.
3. Design the webpage using HTML and CSS.
4. Display available doctors with their specializations and consultation fees.
5. Allow patients to select a doctor and enter their details.
6. Provide options to choose an appointment date and time.
7. Validate patient information and appointment details.
8. Calculate the consultation fee based on the selected doctor.
9. Generate an appointment ID and display the booking details.
10. Stop the program.
